 "notes": "Codes expanded from the title score line (Thornton Academy, Gorham, Noble, Portland): TA, G, N, P. Shot Put 1 Huntress has no school code printed (Huntress is TA in Discus); school left empty, not guessed. Places are as printed; several first places and some others lack a number in the source (Pole Vault, 4x800, 100H, 100, Shot Put 1) and were inferred from order. Javelin 3 Emerson printed as 61' 9 1.5\"; mark kept as printed (61-9 1.5), could mean 9.5 in. Typos fixed: 1600 Bean 6;21.1 -> 6:21.1; 800 Pomroy 2;31.2 -> 2:31.2 and Pierce 2;38.4 -> 2:38.4; 400 '1:12.45. Poulin' read as Felbaum 1:12.4 then 5. Poulin; Pole Vault Rowell '7-0:' -> 7-00. Marks written as printed otherwise: 3200 White '14:44', 4x400 G '4:29', Triple Jump Chapman '4.75' lacks inches mark. Ties kept as printed places (100H Hall/Arnold 17.1 as 2,3; 100 Reaser/Beaulir 13.5 as 2,3; 200 Stillson/Durie 29.4 as 2,3; Gibbons 13-06 3rd after Nystrom 13-06 2nd; HJ Swiatek/O'Connor 4-06 as 3,4). Names as printed incl. likely misspellings (Villanueua, Beaulir, Kazzkarek). Relay athletes not listed in source. 1600 Meter Racewalk recorded as 1600 Meter Race Walk."
